    {
      "id": "scout-kavi",
      "name": "Kavi Greenhood",
      "species": "Elf",
      "gender": "Female",
      "age": 128,
      "occupation": "Wilderness Scout",
      "category": "travelers",
      "tags": [
        "scout",
        "forest",
        "trails"
      ],
      "description": "Familiar face at trailheads outside town; useful, stubborn, and hard to surprise.",
      "biography": "People looking for a reliable wilderness scout are often sent to Kavi, who claims trailheads outside town as familiar ground. At 128, this Elf has learned to watch hands before faces. She leaves stacked stones as silent letters; neighbors joke that she would miss a festival before misplacing the green hood faded almost gray. Walks with Yara; reports odd trails to Serra sometimes. She is saving courage and coin alike to keep a safe trail for pilgrims and herbalists, while trying not to let town politics spilling into the woods decide the ending. Found Yara's feverwort patch flagged with chalk arrows toward the mill.",
      "personality": "Proud of competence more than praise; leaves stacked stones as silent letters.",
      "motivation": "Protect her livelihood long enough to keep a safe trail for pilgrims and herbalists.",
      "secret": "Has not told allies the truth: Found Yara's feverwort patch flagged with chalk arrows toward the mill.",
      "rumor": "A smugglers' mark was seen near trailheads outside town on a night Kavi worked late.",
      "voice": "Measured elf cadence; concrete nouns before adjectives.",
      "appearance": "Work-worn elf garb; the green hood faded almost gray always nearby.",
