      "description": "Asha holds down roadside shrines with callused competence and open ears.",
      "biography": "Asha Roadbless works from roadside shrines with the stubborn patience of a 50-year-old Human who has already survived harder seasons. She washes her feet before every gate, and keeps the walking staff carved with mercy marks close when tempers rise. Guest of Elen's temple; rejected Orin. Her private aim is simple: reach three temples before winter. Still, she flinches at the thought of faithful folk turned away for being poor. Lately a fresh problem has landed in her lap: Was offered 'safe passage' papers by Pale Orin for a 'donation'.",
