    {
      "id": "hunter-vessa",
      "name": "Vessa Coldtrail",
      "species": "Half-Orc",
      "gender": "Female",
      "age": 31,
      "occupation": "Game Hunter",
      "category": "travelers",
      "tags": [
        "hunter",
        "furs",
        "camp"
      ],
      "description": "Local game hunter whose days orbit woodland trails near town and small lasting loyalties.",
      "biography": "Walk into woodland trails near town and you will find Vessa Coldtrail before you find a free chair. A 31-year-old Half-Orc game hunter, Vessa greets trouble the way other folk greet weather: with a coat and a plan. She shares meat before she shares names. The fur roll tied with sinew travels with her almost everywhere. Friends with Skog; confirms Kavi's trail signs. Her ambition is to sell honest furs without guild bribes. Her nightmare is overhunting for noble fashion. Right now, Tracked armed strangers caching rope near the mill at dusk.",
      "personality": "Dry humor over a careful heart; shares meat before she shares names.",
      "motivation": "Finish one honest plan: sell honest furs without guild bribes.",
      "secret": "Keeps proof related to a problem—Tracked armed strangers caching rope near the mill at dusk.",
