      "description": "A long-road courier rooted at waystations and courier posts, known for how he never sleeps in the same loft twice.",
      "biography": "Blink Feather's reputation as a long-road courier was built one careful errand at a time around waystations and courier posts. Age 23 sits lightly on this Halfling, except when old debts creak. Watch long enough and you will see that he never sleeps in the same loft twice. The sealable message tube worn as a belt is part tool, part talisman. Idol for Finn; professional pride. He would trade sleep to hire Finn as a second when the boy is ready, yet stays wary of being forced to open a letter. Current spark: Carried a sealed note from Kitty Shade to someone inside the noble estate.",
